   "title": "Low WBC (< 4 × 10⁹/L): is it NEUTROPENIA, how SEVERE, and is there FEVER?",
   "lines": [
    "neutropenia = absolute neutrophil count (ANC) < 1.5 × 10⁹/L: the usual cause",
    "mild 1.0–1.5 · moderate 0.5–0.99 · SEVERE < 0.5"
   ]
  },
